cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Eoulsan, please cite it using the preferred citation below."
title: "Eoulsan"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Eoulsan is a versatile open-source workflow engine for automated and
  reproducible analysis of high-throughput sequencing data, including bulk
  RNA-seq, long-read RNA-seq (Oxford Nanopore Technologies) and single-cell
  RNA-seq (Smart-seq2 and 10x Genomics). It runs on workstations, Hadoop
  clusters and various job schedulers, and supports Galaxy tool wrappers and
  Docker or Singularity containers.
